hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"22690","Surayj and Affan said, Abu Awanah narrated to us, al-Hurr ibn al-Sayyah narrated to us, Surayj said: from al-Hurr, from Hunaydah ibn Khalid, from his wife, from some wives of the Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, who said: The Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, used to fast nine of Dhu al-Hijjah, the day of Ashura, and three days of every month. Affan said: The first Monday of the month and two Thursdays."
